Attention, soldiers! We have received a distress signal from planet Anthracite. Your mission begins on April 15th!

[previewyoutube=1L-xw4nbD6Q;full][/previewyoutube]

Your elite squad of mercenaries will journey through the beautiful yet dangerous environments of the exotic planet over the course of a 20-hour-long singleplayer campaign. Your tactical expertise will be put to test over and over again by the gridless movement system, smart enemies and the well-placed teleports.
But extraterrestrial animals, space pirates, evil robots and enemy governments won’t be the only opposing forces you’ll encounter on Anthracite. Get ready to fight other players in online and hot-seat skirmishes. Compete in Domination and Devastator modes to become the highest ranked commander.


Main features:

 Tactical turn-based strategy with girdless movement - soldiers can gain positional advantage with no restrictions;
 Teleportation - teleports scattered around the battlefield are a powerful tool for flanking opponents, taking cover and even shooting from unexpected angles;
 Vast squad customization options - a wide variety of futuristic weapons and several character classes allow to adapt the player’s squad to their playstyle.
 Physics-based combat - each shot or grenade throw has to be manually aimed, eliminating the frustrating RNG, known from other tactical strategies;
 Advanced AI - thanks to the Grail AI engine, AI opponents are challenging and behave differently, depending whether they are animals, robots or soldiers;


Tactical Troops: Anthracite Shift by QED Games releases on Steam on April 15th 2021 for 14,99 USD.
